  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Narva VA ut&#xf6;kad f&#xf6;rstudie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Narva W&amp;WW extended FS - extended FS Narva WWTP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extended feasibility studie for renovation of Narva waste Water treatment Plant. A feasibility study presented in 1998 showed that a number of issues still need to be resolved before the project can proceed further to develop proposals on economic and environmental sustainability etc. Swedish part:VAI VA. Sida-support SEK 837 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ut&#xf6;kad genomf&#xf6;rbarhetsstudie f&#xf6;r avloppsreningsverket i Narva. En studie presenterades 1998 d&#xe4;r det framkom att vissa fr&#xe5;gor kvarst&#xe5;r att reda ut innan projektimplementeringen kan fortg&#xe5; att ge f&#xf6;rslag p&#xe5; ekonomiskt och ekologiskt uth&#xe5;lliga investeringar inom VA-sektorn etc. Svensk part &#xe4;r VAI VA, och Sida-bidrag SEK 837 000.</narrative>
  </description>
